# Party layer (party/party.js, party/commands.js, config/ftbteams-server.snbt; WP-S2 of design/architecture/story-characters.md).
# Real FTB Teams parties between test bots (a bot is a real ServerPlayer, so FTB made it a personal team at login).
# Every `ttl party expect`, `ttl story expect` and `ttl rep expect` prints "ttl: ..." when it does not hold. FTB's own commands
# print nothing with that prefix, so each FTB step is proved by an `expect` after it.
# A swears the Oath for the party; the lock (a pass every 3 s) takes a dark soul out again (C), makes an undecided joiner swear
# the party's Oath (D, E), and FTB's max_party_size (5) refuses the sixth member (F).
# Bots do not move: nothing here depends on distance. Parties are FTB world data, so the end (and the start, in case an older run
# stopped half way) leaves every party: members first, the leader last.
# Expect in the log: "[ttl] story: TtlBotPrtyC turned away from the party of TtlBotPrtyA (dark against light)",
# "TtlBotPrtyD joined the party of TtlBotPrtyA and took the light Oath".
# Also check in game (not asserted): the Voice line the turned-away soul reads, `ttl party` output, the FTB team button.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotPrtyA
ttlbot spawn TtlBotPrtyB
ttlbot spawn TtlBotPrtyC
ttlbot spawn TtlBotPrtyD
ttlbot spawn TtlBotPrtyE
ttlbot spawn TtlBotPrtyF
@sleep 2
execute as TtlBotPrtyF run ftbteams party leave
execute as TtlBotPrtyE run ftbteams party leave
execute as TtlBotPrtyD run ftbteams party leave
execute as TtlBotPrtyC run ftbteams party leave
execute as TtlBotPrtyB run ftbteams party leave
execute as TtlBotPrtyA run ftbteams party leave
ttl reset TtlBotPrtyA
ttl reset TtlBotPrtyB
ttl reset TtlBotPrtyC
ttl reset TtlBotPrtyD
ttl reset TtlBotPrtyE
ttl reset TtlBotPrtyF
kubejs stages add TtlBotPrtyA ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotPrtyB ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotPrtyC ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotPrtyD ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotPrtyE ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotPrtyF ttl.life2
# The size cap is FTB's own knob; 5 only holds if the pack default is not overridden in world/serverconfig.
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA cap 5
# Alone: a party of one (the answer story.js and boss.js fall back to).
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA in no
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA members 1
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA total 1
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA owner yes
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA boss 0
execute as TtlBotPrtyA run ttl party
# A leads a party; B joins it (an invitation is needed).
execute as TtlBotPrtyA run ftbteams party create PrtyTest
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA in yes
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA owner yes
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA members 1
execute as TtlBotPrtyA run ftbteams party invite TtlBotPrtyB
execute as TtlBotPrtyB run ftbteams party join @a[name=TtlBotPrtyA]
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyB in yes
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyB owner no
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyB same TtlBotPrtyA yes
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA members 2
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA total 2
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyB members 2
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyC same TtlBotPrtyA no
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA path none
# Boss credit reads the same party (no ttl.boss.testparty set here).
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyB boss 2
# The leader's Oath binds the party: B takes it without choosing (story.js membersOf/isOwner/teamId).
ttl story expect TtlBotPrtyB path none
execute as TtlBotPrtyA run ttl story oath light
ttl story expect TtlBotPrtyA path light
ttl story expect TtlBotPrtyB path light
ttl story expect TtlBotPrtyB stage ttl.path.light yes
ttl story expect TtlBotPrtyB act 1 yes
ttl rep expect TtlBotPrtyB tempest value 20
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA path light
# C swore the dark Oath: invited and joined, it is turned away again within a few seconds and keeps its own path.
ttl story set TtlBotPrtyC dark
execute as TtlBotPrtyA run ftbteams party invite TtlBotPrtyC
execute as TtlBotPrtyC run ftbteams party join @a[name=TtlBotPrtyA]
@sleep 7
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyC in no
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA total 2
ttl story expect TtlBotPrtyC path dark
ttl story expect TtlBotPrtyC stage ttl.path.dark yes
# D has not sworn: the lock gives it the party's Oath (light), Act I included.
execute as TtlBotPrtyA run ftbteams party invite TtlBotPrtyD
execute as TtlBotPrtyD run ftbteams party join @a[name=TtlBotPrtyA]
@sleep 7
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyD in yes
ttl story expect TtlBotPrtyD path light
ttl story expect TtlBotPrtyD stage ttl.path.light yes
ttl story expect TtlBotPrtyD act 1 yes
ttl rep expect TtlBotPrtyD tempest value 20
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA total 3
# E the same. The party is four.
execute as TtlBotPrtyA run ftbteams party invite TtlBotPrtyE
execute as TtlBotPrtyE run ftbteams party join @a[name=TtlBotPrtyA]
@sleep 7
ttl story expect TtlBotPrtyE path light
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA members 4
# C turned light (state only, no deltas) is welcome: the fifth member fills the cap.
ttl story set TtlBotPrtyC light
execute as TtlBotPrtyA run ftbteams party invite TtlBotPrtyC
execute as TtlBotPrtyC run ftbteams party join @a[name=TtlBotPrtyA]
@sleep 7
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyC in yes
ttl story expect TtlBotPrtyC path light
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA members 5
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA total 5
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA boss 5
# Cap 5: FTB refuses the sixth (invite or join), so F stays out.
execute as TtlBotPrtyA run ftbteams party invite TtlBotPrtyF
execute as TtlBotPrtyF run ftbteams party join @a[name=TtlBotPrtyA]
@sleep 4
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyF in no
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA total 5
execute as TtlBotPrtyA run ttl party
# Leaving keeps the soul's path and the party shrinks.
execute as TtlBotPrtyB run ftbteams party leave
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyB in no
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyB members 1
ttl story expect TtlBotPrtyB path light
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA total 4
# Clean up: members first, the leader last (a party disappears with its last member).
execute as TtlBotPrtyC run ftbteams party leave
execute as TtlBotPrtyD run ftbteams party leave
execute as TtlBotPrtyE run ftbteams party leave
execute as TtlBotPrtyA run ftbteams party leave
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyA in no
ttl party expect TtlBotPrtyD in no
ttl party poll
ttl story reset TtlBotPrtyA
ttl story reset TtlBotPrtyB
ttl story reset TtlBotPrtyC
ttl story reset TtlBotPrtyD
ttl story reset TtlBotPrtyE
ttl reset TtlBotPrtyA
ttl reset TtlBotPrtyB
ttl reset TtlBotPrtyC
ttl reset TtlBotPrtyD
ttl reset TtlBotPrtyE
ttl reset TtlBotPrtyF
ttlbot remove TtlBotPrtyA
ttlbot remove TtlBotPrtyB
ttlbot remove TtlBotPrtyC
ttlbot remove TtlBotPrtyD
ttlbot remove TtlBotPrtyE
ttlbot remove TtlBotPrtyF
ttl
